---
import { artist } from '../../data/artist';
import '../../styles/global.css';
const siteUrl='https://www.djkist.it/';
const canonical=siteUrl+'sessioni/plug-radio/';
const title='KIST — Plug Radio · DJ set del 26 settembre 2026';
const description='Guarda la sessione di KIST per Plug Radio del 26 settembre 2026: 53 minuti di DJ set. Scopri il suo suono e proponi booking o collaborazioni.';
const youtubeUrl='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sP0j9EdBOxc';
const embedUrl='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/sP0j9EdBOxc';
const thumbnail='https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sP0j9EdBOxc/hqdefault.jpg';
const artistId=siteUrl+'#kist';
const videoId=siteUrl+'#plug-radio-session';
const structuredData={
 '@context':'https://schema.org',
 '@graph':[
  {'@type':'WebPage','@id':canonical+'#webpage',url:canonical,name:title,description,inLanguage:'it-IT',isPartOf:{'@id':siteUrl+'#website'},mainEntity:{'@id':videoId}},
  {
   '@type':'VideoObject','@id':videoId,name:'KIST — Plug Radio',description:'Sessione di KIST per Plug Radio del 26 settembre 2026.',
   url:canonical,sameAs:youtubeUrl,embedUrl,thumbnailUrl:thumbnail,duration:'PT53M12S',
   // Official YouTube playerMicroformatRenderer uploadDate; the performance date is separate.
   uploadDate:'2026-09-26T23:02:32-07:00',about:{'@id':artistId},mainEntityOfPage:{'@id':canonical+'#webpage'},
   publisher:{'@type':'Organization',name:'Plug Radio',url:'https://www.youtube.com/@plugradio'},
  },
  {'@type':'Person','@id':artistId,name:'KIST',url:siteUrl,jobTitle:'DJ e selector',homeLocation:{'@type':'City',name:'Bologna'},sameAs:[artist.instagram,artist.soundcloud]},
 ],
};
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
 <title>{title}</title>
 <meta name="description" content={description}/>
 <meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large,max-video-preview:-1"/>
 <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0c17"/>
 <link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/>
 <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/>
 <meta property="og:type" content="video.other"/>
 <meta property="og:locale" content="it_IT"/>
 <meta property="og:site_name" content="DJ KIST"/>
 <meta property="og:title" content={title}/>
 <meta property="og:description" content={description}/>
 <meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/>
 <meta property="og:image" content={thumbnail}/>
 <meta property="og:image:alt" content="KIST — sessione per Plug Radio del 26 settembre 2026"/>
 <meta property="og:video" content={embedUrl}/>
 <meta property="og:video:type" content="text/html"/>
 <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/>
 <meta name="twitter:title" content={title}/>
 <meta name="twitter:description" content={description}/>
 <meta name="twitter:image" content={thumbnail}/>
 <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData).replace(/</g,'\\u003c')}/>
</head>
<body class="session-page">
 <a class="session-skip" href="#session-video">Vai al video</a>
 <header class="session-header">
  <a class="session-brand" href="/" aria-label="KIST, torna al sito"><img src="/media/kist-wordmark-imagegen.webp" width="82" height="27" alt="KIST"/></a>
  <a class="session-back" href="/">Torna al mondo KIST <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
 </header>
 <main class="session-main">
  <div class="session-heading"><span class="session-edition">SESSIONI / PLUG RADIO</span><h1>KIST — Plug Radio</h1><p><time datetime="2026-09-26">26 settembre 2026</time><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>53:12</span></p></div>
  <div class="session-player" id="session-video" tabindex="-1"><iframe src={embedUrl} title="DJ set KIST — Plug Radio, 26 settembre 2026" loading="eager" allow="encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>
  <div class="session-notes">
   <div><h2>Una sessione intera, da ascoltare.</h2><p>Il set di KIST per Plug Radio del 26 settembre 2026, pubblicato sul canale della radio. Premi play per guardare la sessione completa, oppure <a href={youtubeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aprila su YouTube</a>.</p><p>KIST è una DJ di origini lucane, con base a Bologna. Dal breakbeat alla jungle e alla drum and bass, il suo percorso attraversa UK garage, funky e acid techno. <a href="/#about">Conosci KIST</a>.</p></div>
   <aside class="session-booking" aria-labelledby="session-booking-title"><span>LA PROSSIMA NOTTE</span><h2 id="session-booking-title">Un set, un progetto, insieme.</h2><p>Per proporre una serata o una collaborazione, scrivi a KIST indicando data, città, luogo e idea dell’evento.</p><a class="session-cta" href={artist.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Booking su Instagram <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="session-listen" href={artist.soundcloud} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ascolta gli altri set su SoundCloud <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
  </div>
 </main>
 <footer class="session-footer"><a href="/">DJ KIST / Bologna</a><a href="/#diary">Notti e prossime date</a><span>Personal frequency</span></footer>
</body>
</html>
<style>
 :global(body.session-page){min-width:0;margin:0;background:#0b0c17;color:#eeedf5;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;isolation:isolate}
 .session-page:before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 4%,#7145ac25,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 64%,#39b7c914,transparent 55%),#0b0c17}
 .session-skip{position:fixed;top:-80px;left:20px;z-index:100;padding:13px 20px;background:#c9ff52;color:#0b0c17;border-radius:4px}
 .session-skip:focus{top:12px}
 .session-header{position:relative;inset:auto;width:100%;max-width:1440px;min-height:82px;padding:20px 5%;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #b3a0da26;background:none}
 .session-brand{display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:82px}
 .session-brand img{display:block;width:82px;height:auto}
 .session-back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;min-height:44px;font-size:12px;color:#d8cfea}
 .session-back:hover{color:#c9ff52}
 .session-main{width:min(1120px,90%);margin:0 auto;padding:44px 0 64px}
 .session-heading{margin-bottom:26px}
 .session-edition{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#aa93d2;margin-bottom:14px}
 h1{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(32px,4.7vw,62px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 16px}
 .session-heading>p{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:13px;color:#c0b4d5;margin:0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 .session-player{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;overflow:hidden;background:#020205;border:1px solid #b49bd940;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 24px 70px #0005}
 .session-player iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border:0}
 .session-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(0,.8fr);gap:clamp(24px,5vw,72px);padding-top:44px}
 .session-notes h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(23px,2.1vw,30px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px}
 .session-notes p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#c8bfd9;margin:0 0 20px;max-width:62ch}
 .session-notes p a{color:#eee8fb;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#bda0f075;text-underline-offset:4px}
 .session-notes p a:hover{color:#c9ff52}
 .session-booking{align-self:start;padding:25px;border:1px solid #b99bd934;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#8d4fdb12,#77d8e408)}
 .session-booking>span{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#af9bcb;margin-bottom:15px}
 .session-booking p{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:24px}
 .session-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;min-height:50px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid #c9ff5266;border-radius:30px;background:#c9ff52;color:#0b0c17;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
 .session-cta:hover{background:#dbff8b}
 .session-listen{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;min-height:44px;margin-top:12px;padding:6px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#c4b7da}
 .session-listen:hover{color:#c9ff52}
 .session-footer{position:relative;width:min(1120px,90%);margin:0 auto;padding:25px 0 32px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;font-size:11px;color:#a799ba;border-top:1px solid #b3a0da26}
 .session-footer a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px}
 @media(max-width:700px){.session-header{min-height:72px;padding:14px 5%;gap:14px}.session-back{font-size:11px;gap:9px}.session-main{padding:30px 0 42px}.session-heading{margin-bottom:22px}.session-edition{font-size:9px}h1{max-width:12ch;font-size:clamp(32px,8.8vw,48px)}.session-heading>p{font-size:12px;gap:10px}.session-player{border-radius:4px}.session-notes{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:30px;gap:20px}.session-notes p{font-size:14px}.session-booking{padding:22px}.session-footer{padding-top:18px}}
</style>
